  "stem": "In a sample space of ${=total}$ equally likely outcomes, $n(A) = {=na}$, $n(B) = {=nb}$ and $n(A \\text{ and } B) = {=nab}$. Find $P(A \\text{ or } B)$.",
  "solution": [
    "$P(A \\text{ or } B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\text{ and } B)$.",
    "$n(A \\text{ or } B) = {=na} + {=nb} - {=nab} = {=na + nb - nab}$.",
    "$P(A \\text{ or } B) = {=frac(na + nb - nab, total)} = {=Fraction(na + nb - nab, total)}$."
  ],
